      "value": "I was successful at putting the Flower Crown on 2 of my human headed avatars, and 5 of my non-human headed avatars last night.  But still not able to put it on the Dryadia avatar I uploaded.  (and I was successful in putting it on the test Dryadia Model com).  Please let me know if there is anything i can do to help sort out the glitch...like if i need to re-upload the Dryadia avatar.  Thank you.",
