  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I took off the antlers and leafy crown of my Dryadia avatar, but still can't put the Flower Crown on her in the accessories application window; the position, rotation, and scale sliders move correctly, and I have the 'head' bone selected, but it won't let the Flower Crown be put into the correct position on her head.  I have put Flower Crowns successfully on other avatars, and the 'test Dryadia', that the creator made for me to test her.  So I do know how to put the Flower Crown on correctly.  I'm including screenshots of successful applications with other avatars, and unsuccessful applications with my Dryadia avatar.  I reset and clicked 'undo' several times, and relogged, etc., dozens of times over several days of trying. avtr_22cfbcba-0767-4819-9a11-e27858cf6b46",
